**Azure Monitor:** install `azure-monitor-opentelemetry` and call `configure_azure_monitor()`. It auto-instruments common libs (FastAPI, requests, SQLAlchemy) and ships logs + traces via OTel exporter.

**Don't:** log secrets, tokens, full prompts/responses with PII; exceed quotas with `DEBUG` in prod; reconfigure logging in library code (only the app entry point should).
